WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:14.333
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.208
<c.Caption-C6_1>When you feel down

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:34.083
<c.Caption-C7_1>And you are at your wit's end

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:37.833
<c.Caption-C8_1>Ask the Popotan for advice

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<c.Caption-C9_1>Yes, if you can be honest

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.708
<c.Caption-C10_1>And open up your heart

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.958
<c.Caption-C11_1>The Popotan will show the way

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.833
<c.Caption-C12_1>Will he come or not?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.541
<c.Caption-C13_1>Does he love me or not?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Is this love true or false?

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:02.208
<c.Caption-C15_1>They have all the answers

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.625
<c.Caption-C16_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.416
<c.Caption-C17_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:13.916
<c.Caption-C18_1>I know, but I just can't stop!

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.458
<c.Caption-C19_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:18.875
<c.Caption-C20_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.666
<c.Caption-C21_1>Even if it's just a dream, never give up!

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:36.750
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Yes?

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:40.208
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>Yes? Is that so?

00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:41.750
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Thank you very much.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>What did they say?

00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:46.125
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>There's none in this area.

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:47.041
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Right.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.916
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>I guess we can search

00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:50.916
<c.Subtitle-C8_2>somewhere else, then.

00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:54.791
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>Ai!

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.500
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Mai!

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.458
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>Aww! What're you doing, Mii?!

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.041
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>I've decided!

00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:05.375
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>That I'm going to be a magical girl!

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:10.541
<c.Caption-C23_1>Magic

00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:19.625
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Lilo! Lilo!

00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:21.958
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Lilo! Lilo! Lilo!

00:02:19.626 --> 00:02:21.958
<c.Subtitle-C16_2>I see. So that's it.

00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:24.916
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Some stupid half-baked idea

00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:24.916
<c.Subtitle-C17_2>you got from somewhere.

00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:27.458
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>It's not half-baked.

00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:29.833
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>I'm going to be a magical girl like Lilo!

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:32.375
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>But that's TV!

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>There's no way!

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:34.458
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>But I will!

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:37.916
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Lilo says your dreams will come true

00:02:34.459 --> 00:02:37.916
<c.Subtitle-C23_2>if you believe in them!

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:42.208
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>My, my. What's going on, you two?

00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:43.916
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Ai!

00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:45.666
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>I'll become one, right?

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:47.791
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>I can be a magical girl, right?

00:02:47.791 --> 00:02:49.875
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>You've got to talk to her, Ai.

00:02:49.875 --> 00:02:52.750
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>There's no way anything

00:02:49.876 --> 00:02:52.750
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>like that could become real.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>I didn't ask you, Mai!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:01.250
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>Well, how about we start

00:02:57.501 --> 00:03:01.250
<c.Subtitle-C31_2>by taking on the right look?

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:05.250
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Look?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.583
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>I'm looking for clothes just like this.

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.083
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Right.

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:24.791
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>Unfortunately, we don't carry

00:03:20.126 --> 00:03:24.791
<c.Subtitle-C35_2>merchandise like that.

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.625
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>What? You don't have it?

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:27.458
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>See?

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:31.000
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Well, you could have it custom-tailored.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.125
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Custom-tailored?

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.833
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>In order to custom-tailor

00:03:32.501 --> 00:03:34.833
<c.Subtitle-C40_2>something like this...

00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:36.625
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>...it'll cost about this much.

00:03:38.916 --> 00:03:41.708
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>All right. We'd like you to do it.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.541
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>Ai?

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:46.791
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>First, I need you to choose

00:03:43.876 --> 00:03:46.791
<c.Subtitle-C44_2>the underlying garment.

00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:47.791
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Okay!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.000
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Okay!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:49.916
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Uh, um...

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:01.875
<c.Caption-C24_1>Merry Popotan

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:00.125
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Hello?

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:01.875
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>I'd like to order three

00:04:00.126 --> 00:04:01.875
<c.Subtitle-C49_2>special sushi combos.

00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:03.416
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>This one!

00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Very well.

00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:08.166
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>You'll have to wait a little bit

00:04:04.959 --> 00:04:08.166
<c.Subtitle-C52_2>while we make this.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Thank you very much.

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.000
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Right.

00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:14.875
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>So what're we going to do, Ai?

00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>Even if we want to search for popotan

00:04:14.876 --> 00:04:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C56_2>while we wait there's none around here.

00:04:19.708 --> 00:04:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>If that's the case,

00:04:19.709 --> 00:04:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C57_2>there's only one answer.

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:26.666
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>So...

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.625
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>...why the underwear department?

00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:39.666
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>What do you think?

00:04:39.916 --> 00:04:43.708
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>Um, do you have anything

00:04:39.917 --> 00:04:43.708
<c.Subtitle-C61_2>larger than this?

00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:44.916
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>I'm very sorry.

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:46.833
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>You won't find that anywhere.

00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.375
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>It's too big. It won't fit me.

00:04:49.375 --> 00:04:50.875
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>I need something much smaller.

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:52.000
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>I'm very sorry.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.166
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>You won't find that anywhere.

00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:06.833
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>Did you find what you wanted?

00:05:06.875 --> 00:05:08.750
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>Uh, Ai?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>It's important for a girl

00:05:08.751 --> 00:05:12.375
<c.Subtitle-C70_2>to have her secret charms.

00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:14.458
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>I didn't ask!

00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:16.375
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>What do you think of this, Mai?

00:05:14.459 --> 00:05:16.375
<c.Subtitle-C72_2>Now, look at that!

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:18.666
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Yes.

00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:20.500
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Try it on.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Try it! Try it!

00:05:20.501 --> 00:05:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C75_2>No, I mean...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:22.416
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>Try it! Try it!

00:05:28.916 --> 00:05:30.458
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>Well? Mai?

00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:32.583
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>Well?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.916
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>I don't want it!

00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:52.875
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>Ta-daa!

00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:56.958
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>Here's Magical Girl Mii!

00:05:57.375 --> 00:05:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>You look very cute, Mii.

00:05:59.666 --> 00:06:00.833
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>Oh, yes.

00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:02.500
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Come on, now.

00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:04.750
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>Thank you! Thank you!

00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:06.666
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>Yes. That's very good. Very nice.

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:08.125
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>You see? You see?

00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>Now, it's time for me to find

00:06:08.334 --> 00:06:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C88_2>and help people in trouble!

00:06:13.458 --> 00:06:15.333
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>All right! Let's go, Unagi!

00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:22.958
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>A magical girl has to have

00:06:18.459 --> 00:06:22.958
<c.Subtitle-C90_2>a mysterious pet!

00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:28.083
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>Come on! Get on with it!

00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>Okay! Magical, let's go!

00:06:30.916 --> 00:06:32.875
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>Wait a minute, Mii.

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Are you sure about this, Ai?

00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>Uh, the bill.

00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>Right. Right.

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:46.083
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>The bill.

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>Ai?

00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:54.541
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>Do you have any small change?

00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.333
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>I asked you to hang on to my wallet.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Oh, I'll buy you another one.

00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:11.416
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>Here I am!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:29.416
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>I am Mii! The Magical Girl

00:07:25.751 --> 00:07:29.416
<c.Subtitle-C104_2>of Love and Peace!

00:07:29.625 --> 00:07:30.791
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>With a pet, too!

00:07:32.791 --> 00:07:35.625
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Please tell me what's troubling you.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:40.041
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>My balloon.

00:07:40.041 --> 00:07:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>The balloon I got from the

00:07:40.042 --> 00:07:43.625
<c.Subtitle-C108_2>pretty sales campaign girl.

00:07:43.833 --> 00:07:45.916
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>If you told me before...

00:07:45.916 --> 00:07:47.833
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>...I could've grabbed it.

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:48.916
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>I suppose.

00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>It's all right! I will use my magic

00:07:49.459 --> 00:07:53.500
<c.Subtitle-C112_2>and get it for you!

00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:57.458
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>Again.

00:08:03.458 --> 00:08:06.666
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:11.458
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Oh, boy.

00:08:12.708 --> 00:08:15.750
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>My balloon! The one that girl gave me!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.958
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>I'll buy you another one.

00:08:17.958 --> 00:08:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>It has to be from the girl!

00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:37.958
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>Got it!

00:08:42.625 --> 00:08:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>The balloon!

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:48.208
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>See? Your balloon!

00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:49.041
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Here!

00:08:49.416 --> 00:08:51.083
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Whenever you're in trouble, Mii is...

00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:52.916
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Am I in trouble!

00:08:52.916 --> 00:08:54.541
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>The voice of someone in trouble!

00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:56.291
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Just leave it to me!

00:08:56.291 --> 00:08:59.041
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>Well, Magical Goodbye!

00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>Goodbye.

00:09:10.833 --> 00:09:11.708
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Hello?

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:15.875
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>One each of miso butter, soy butter,

00:09:11.709 --> 00:09:15.875
<c.Subtitle-C131_2>and pork butter ramen noodles.

00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:36.125
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:09:38.208 --> 00:09:39.916
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:45.333
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>I am Mii! The Magical Girl

00:09:41.459 --> 00:09:45.333
<c.Subtitle-C134_2>of Love and Peace!

00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>And again!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.541
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>Please tell me what's troubling you.

00:10:00.041 --> 00:10:01.750
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>I've found you!

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.833
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>I've found you! I've found you!

00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:12.916
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Popotan!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:17.958
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Popotan!

00:10:23.375 --> 00:10:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>You're sure it was around here?

00:10:23.376 --> 00:10:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C141_2>Where Mii came?

00:10:26.583 --> 00:10:27.541
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>Yes.

00:10:27.541 --> 00:10:29.500
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>The flowers are saying so.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.583
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Good grief. Where did she wander off to?

00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:36.166
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>I wish she were a little more considerate.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>What? What's the matter?

00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:40.750
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>Well, um...

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.666
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>...the flowers say they saw Mii

00:10:42.001 --> 00:10:46.666
<c.Subtitle-C148_2>walking somewhere...

00:10:46.666 --> 00:10:47.916
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>...with a man.

00:10:48.166 --> 00:10:50.666
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>A man?! Who?

00:10:50.666 --> 00:10:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>I don't know.

00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:56.083
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>I don't think she knows

00:10:52.334 --> 00:10:56.083
<c.Subtitle-C152_2>anyone around here.

00:10:56.708 --> 00:10:58.166
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Then...

00:11:01.541 --> 00:11:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Don't tell me! Ai, it could be...?

00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>A long lost brother?

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:09.208
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Huh? We don't have a brother!

00:11:09.583 --> 00:11:11.083
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Oh, that's right.

00:11:11.916 --> 00:11:13.750
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Where? Where?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.791
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>Here?

00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>All right!

00:11:18.291 --> 00:11:20.500
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>I am Mii! The Magical Girl

00:11:20.501 --> 00:11:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C162_2>of Love and Peace!

00:11:23.791 --> 00:11:25.500
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>And I've got my pet, Unagi!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.791
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>What's troubling you?

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:34.541
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>Please tell me! I mean, let's be friends!

00:11:36.291 --> 00:11:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>You have a Lilo doll?

00:11:36.292 --> 00:11:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C166_2>And a Lilo poster?

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.583
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>And Lilo books? And Lilo pajamas!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:46.291
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>Could it be that you really, really like Lilo?

00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:48.125
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>Yes.

00:11:48.125 --> 00:11:50.791
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>I really like Lilo, too!

00:11:50.791 --> 00:11:52.333
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Let's be friends! Let's be friends!

00:11:52.666 --> 00:11:55.333
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Let's be friends! I mean it!

00:11:52.667 --> 00:11:55.333
<c.Subtitle-C172_2>Let's be friends!

00:11:59.666 --> 00:12:03.375
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>Hey, can you show me

00:11:59.667 --> 00:12:03.375
<c.Subtitle-C173_2>some of your Lilo books?

00:12:03.375 --> 00:12:04.875
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Please!

00:12:05.041 --> 00:12:05.916
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>Sure.

00:12:07.333 --> 00:12:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Wow! Thanks!

00:12:09.375 --> 00:12:10.416
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>There!

00:12:11.166 --> 00:12:14.666
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Wow, Lilo is wonderful

00:12:11.167 --> 00:12:14.666
<c.Subtitle-C178_2>no matter how you look at her.

00:12:14.666 --> 00:12:15.875
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>Don't you think?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>Huh? Yeah.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:23.416
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>Isn't Lilo just so cute? Don't you think?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.500
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>There we go!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.166
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>Okay! Let's go!

00:12:50.666 --> 00:12:51.666
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>Hello?

00:12:51.666 --> 00:12:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>Italian chicken pizza, seafood

00:12:51.667 --> 00:12:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C185_2>cheese pizza, and sausage pizza.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.333
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>All large.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.291
<c.Caption-C25_1>Reception

00:12:57.458 --> 00:12:58.333
<c.Caption-C26_1>Magical Girl Reception

00:13:00.541 --> 00:13:02.916
<c.Caption-C27_1>Magical Girl

00:13:00.542 --> 00:13:02.916
<c.Caption-C27_2>Reception

00:13:02.916 --> 00:13:04.875
<c.Caption-C28_1>Pediatrics

00:13:05.666 --> 00:13:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>No! I don't want a needle!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.583
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>It's not going to hurt.

00:13:06.501 --> 00:13:10.583
<c.Subtitle-C188_2>No! I don't want a needle!

00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:12.875
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.250
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Ta-daa!

00:13:15.708 --> 00:13:19.083
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>I am Mii! The Magical Girl

00:13:15.709 --> 00:13:19.083
<c.Subtitle-C191_2>of Love and Peace!

00:13:19.416 --> 00:13:21.083
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>And this is Miyuki!

00:13:22.916 --> 00:13:25.000
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Those evildoers who make children cry!

00:13:25.041 --> 00:13:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>M-Mii...

00:13:26.541 --> 00:13:29.708
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>You've got to have courage

00:13:26.542 --> 00:13:29.708
<c.Subtitle-C195_2>and fight with me!

00:13:30.208 --> 00:13:33.791
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>Evildoers shall deal with the Magical Stick!

00:13:33.791 --> 00:13:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>That's right!

00:13:34.958 --> 00:13:36.666
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>Look, you two!

00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:40.333
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>There you are! The evil mastermind!

00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:40.333
<c.Subtitle-C199_2>Nurse Demon!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.708
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>M-Mii...

00:13:43.666 --> 00:13:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>You have no business here, so get out!

00:14:04.291 --> 00:14:06.666
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>I bought some candy, so if you'd like...

00:14:10.416 --> 00:14:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Where are they?

00:14:11.583 --> 00:14:13.166
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Oh, no!

00:14:13.541 --> 00:14:15.916
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Is Mii in this hospital?

00:14:15.916 --> 00:14:17.000
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Yes.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>That's what the flowers said.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.958
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>Miyuki! Miyuki!

00:14:18.501 --> 00:14:20.958
<c.Subtitle-C208_2>But how will we find her?

00:14:20.958 --> 00:14:21.500
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>But how will we find her?

00:14:21.708 --> 00:14:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>Let's ask.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.666
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>Um, excuse me...

00:14:22.751 --> 00:14:24.666
<c.Subtitle-C211_2>Um, excuse me...

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:28.750
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Did you see a magical girl around here?

00:14:29.166 --> 00:14:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>What?!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.125
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>Wow, that was fun!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.250
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Yeah!

00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:19.458
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>I'll come tomorrow, too!

00:15:19.458 --> 00:15:20.500
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>And the day after, too!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.833
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>Then I'll never be able to leave!

00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:24.750
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>Miyuki? Miyuki?

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:31.000
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>How do you make that ring again?

00:15:34.416 --> 00:15:35.416
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>You see.

00:15:40.958 --> 00:15:42.833
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>Ai! There she is!

00:15:43.291 --> 00:15:44.458
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Thank goodness!

00:15:44.458 --> 00:15:46.875
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>That Mii really had us worried!

00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:48.166
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Wait!

00:15:50.833 --> 00:15:53.000
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>Sir? The man from before?

00:15:55.375 --> 00:15:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Miyuki lost her mother long ago.

00:16:03.666 --> 00:16:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>And Miyuki always had

00:16:03.667 --> 00:16:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C228_2>a weak constitution.

00:16:06.916 --> 00:16:09.125
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>She's been here since she was three.

00:16:10.416 --> 00:16:14.375
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>If she were to get hurt while outside...

00:16:14.375 --> 00:16:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>...she could...

00:16:17.666 --> 00:16:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>This didn't work.

00:16:19.666 --> 00:16:21.541
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>It's not turning into a ring.

00:16:22.583 --> 00:16:23.833
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>Just give it to me.

00:16:24.166 --> 00:16:25.458
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>This is how you do it.

00:16:33.833 --> 00:16:36.083
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>Why won't it turn into a ring?

00:16:36.083 --> 00:16:38.916
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>You've got to pass it through there.

00:16:36.084 --> 00:16:38.916
<c.Subtitle-C237_2>Right there.

00:16:38.916 --> 00:16:39.750
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>Oh, right.

00:16:39.875 --> 00:16:41.875
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>Like this and like this?

00:16:41.916 --> 00:16:44.458
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>And right through here?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>I did it! It's a flower ring!

00:16:47.291 --> 00:16:49.375
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>And this one's like this and this!

00:16:49.416 --> 00:16:51.291
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>And this goes here and here.

00:16:52.083 --> 00:16:53.541
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>Mii.

00:16:55.875 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Um, could you come and play

00:16:55.876 --> 00:17:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C245_2>with me tomorrow, too?

00:17:01.416 --> 00:17:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>Of course!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.000
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>We're friends now, after all!

00:17:06.333 --> 00:17:07.500
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>Really?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.250
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>Yeah! I promise!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.458
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>I promise! And if I don't

00:17:10.251 --> 00:17:13.458
<c.Subtitle-C250_2>keep my promise...

00:17:13.458 --> 00:17:16.250
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>...you can make me swallow needles!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>I promise!

00:17:18.958 --> 00:17:21.375
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>I'm forgetting how to make the ring!

00:17:21.375 --> 00:17:23.583
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>Like this and like this.

00:17:25.833 --> 00:17:29.291
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>No! Which was it?

00:17:25.834 --> 00:17:29.291
<c.Subtitle-C255_2>Where do I pass it through?

00:17:29.666 --> 00:17:32.250
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>No! It didn't work!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>How did it go?!

00:17:33.583 --> 00:17:35.583
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>Huh? Uh, right.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:40.250
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>Let's use those flowers over there

00:17:36.751 --> 00:17:40.250
<c.Subtitle-C259_2>and make a bigger one!

00:17:40.875 --> 00:17:41.541
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>Yeah!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.208
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>Miyuki!

00:17:51.625 --> 00:17:52.750
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>Are you all right?!

00:17:55.708 --> 00:17:56.375
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>Miyuki!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.000
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>Ouch!

00:17:58.375 --> 00:17:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>It hurts!

00:18:00.041 --> 00:18:01.666
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>You'll be all right!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:07.875
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>Mii, the Magical Girl,

00:18:03.001 --> 00:18:07.875
<c.Subtitle-C267_2>can heal a little scratch like that!

00:18:07.958 --> 00:18:08.708
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>What?!

00:18:10.666 --> 00:18:12.583
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>All right! Here I go!

00:18:13.458 --> 00:18:15.875
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:18:15.916 --> 00:18:19.083
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>Make the hurt go away!

00:18:23.416 --> 00:18:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>But magic isn't for real.

00:18:27.625 --> 00:18:31.291
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>Make the hurt go away!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.833
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>Huh? It really healed!

00:19:08.916 --> 00:19:12.625
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>Amazing! It really did heal!

00:19:12.666 --> 00:19:13.833
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>Really?!

00:19:13.875 --> 00:19:17.333
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>Amazing! You really can use magic!

00:19:19.416 --> 00:19:21.708
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>Aw, this is nothing.

00:19:21.791 --> 00:19:22.833
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>Miyuki!

00:19:23.958 --> 00:19:26.583
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>Papa! Guess what! Guess what!

00:19:26.583 --> 00:19:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>Mii's amazing! Mii can really use magic!

00:19:31.083 --> 00:19:32.250
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>You see...

00:19:32.416 --> 00:19:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>Okay, okay.

00:19:33.791 --> 00:19:36.166
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>It's time for your medical tests, Miyuki.

00:19:36.166 --> 00:19:38.291
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>The doctor won't like it if we're late.

00:19:39.083 --> 00:19:40.833
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Thank you, young lady.

00:19:41.666 --> 00:19:44.208
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Mii, come tomorrow.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.750
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>Of course! I promise I'll come!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.083
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>See you!

00:20:14.541 --> 00:20:16.833
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>I'm so happy.

00:20:18.125 --> 00:20:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>Really?!

00:20:20.041 --> 00:20:21.083
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>Yes.

00:20:21.083 --> 00:20:24.125
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>This is very unusual.

00:20:24.166 --> 00:20:29.583
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>According to the x-rays,

00:20:24.167 --> 00:20:29.583
<c.Subtitle-C294_2>her illness appears to be cured.

00:20:29.583 --> 00:20:32.541
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>I really don't know how this is.

00:20:39.958 --> 00:20:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>So how was minding

00:20:39.959 --> 00:20:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C296_2>the house today, Mea?

00:20:44.666 --> 00:20:47.541
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>Oh, there was nothing unusual.

00:20:49.333 --> 00:20:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>Well, this sure was an exhausting day.

00:20:52.791 --> 00:20:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>Ta-daa!

00:20:54.666 --> 00:20:56.708
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>I'm going to use my magic...

00:20:56.708 --> 00:21:00.875
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>...and turn this little bathroom

00:20:56.709 --> 00:21:00.875
<c.Subtitle-C301_2>into a gorgeous place!

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.833
<c.Subtitle-C302_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:10.791
<c.Subtitle-C303_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:21:13.708 --> 00:21:14.583
<c.Subtitle-C304_1>Huh?

00:21:15.791 --> 00:21:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C305_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:21:18.625 --> 00:21:21.625
<c.Subtitle-C306_1>Could it be that Mii...

00:21:21.625 --> 00:21:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C307_1>...doesn't realize that her powers

00:21:21.626 --> 00:21:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C307_2>are only good for healing?

00:21:25.875 --> 00:21:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C308_1>What?

00:21:27.041 --> 00:21:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C309_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:21:30.333 --> 00:21:31.458
<c.Subtitle-C310_1>What?

00:21:31.458 --> 00:21:34.250
<c.Subtitle-C311_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:21:36.416 --> 00:21:38.833
<c.Subtitle-C312_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:21:39.333 --> 00:21:43.416
<c.Subtitle-C313_1>I am Mii! The Magical Girl

00:21:39.334 --> 00:21:43.416
<c.Subtitle-C313_2>of Love and Peace!

00:21:43.625 --> 00:21:48.958
<c.Subtitle-C314_1>And I am Miyuki! The Magical

00:21:43.626 --> 00:21:48.958
<c.Subtitle-C314_2>Girl of Love and Peace!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.416
<c.Subtitle-C315_1>Please tell us your troubles!

00:22:11.916 --> 00:22:15.333
<c.Caption-C29_1>I want to love you in technopunk

00:22:15.333 --> 00:22:18.708
<c.Caption-C30_1>I transmit my love through the airwaves

00:22:18.708 --> 00:22:22.250
<c.Caption-C31_1>I want to be romantic with you

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:23.791
<c.Caption-C32_1>I want you to laugh

00:22:23.791 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C33_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:29.000
<c.Caption-C34_1>S.U.K.I. Thump thump love

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:32.500
<c.Caption-C35_1>S.U.K.I. Gimme gimme kiss

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.000
<c.Caption-C36_1>S.U.K.I. Suki suki love

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:39.625
<c.Caption-C37_1>S.U.K.I. You love me? Kiss

00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:41.375
<c.Caption-C38_1>Round and round

00:22:41.375 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C39_1>The needle of the time-space clock

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C40_1>Points to our star charts

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.916
<c.Caption-C41_1>The secret of love is revealed

00:22:49.916 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C42_1>I want to know more about

00:22:49.917 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C42_2>what makes my heart go thump thump

00:22:56.791 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C43_1>If every boy and every girl

00:22:56.792 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C43_2>believed in miracles

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C44_1>We'd be sure to find

00:23:03.626 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C44_2>the berry, berry strawberry day

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C45_1>I'll be fine even if we have to

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C45_2>say goodbye one day

00:23:16.791 --> 00:23:21.500
<c.Caption-C46_1>I still want to tell you just how I love you

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.666
<c.Caption-C47_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:27.875 --> 00:23:30.083
<c.Subtitle-C316_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:44.958
<c.Subtitle-C317_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.083 --> 00:24:03.291
<c.Caption-C48_1>Alone

00:23:47.375 --> 00:23:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C318_1>Okay, the next episode

00:23:47.376 --> 00:23:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C318_2>of Popotan is "Alone".

00:23:50.791 --> 00:23:54.291
<c.Subtitle-C319_1>An old injury to my tail

00:23:50.792 --> 00:23:54.291
<c.Subtitle-C319_2>starts to hurt in the summer.

00:23:54.333 --> 00:23:57.125
<c.Subtitle-C320_1>This injury is a mark of my wildness!

00:23:57.125 --> 00:23:59.125
<c.Subtitle-C321_1>But that doesn't mean...

00:23:59.125 --> 00:24:03.333
<c.Subtitle-C322_1>...Mii bit into my tail when

00:23:59.126 --> 00:24:03.333
<c.Subtitle-C322_2>she mistook me for an eel.

00:24:07.458 --> 00:24:09.666
<c.Subtitle-C323_1>Good night, everyone!
